<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Arden Realty said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Arden Realty said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has raised its rating of Arden Realty Group Inc to outperform from neutral, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 25-7/8.</p>
</text>
